      "title": "Notification Hub: Troubleshooting Upstream Delivery Failures and Timeouts",
      "content_summary": "Provides a comprehensive overview of diagnosing notification delivery failures, SMS timeouts, and file upload issues caused by upstream dependencies, credential issues, or vendor incidents.",
      "content_body": "When users report SMS not delivered or notification timeouts, first check the vendor status page for known incidents affecting the Notification Hub. Verify that API keys and credentials are valid, as expired keys often manifest as silent failures or rate-limiting errors. Ensure system clock synchronization is correct, as time drift can cause authentication timeouts with third-party providers. If configuration checks and credential rotations do not resolve the issue, escalate to engineering to review dependency versions and upstream rate-limiting configurations."
